WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:46.360 --> 01:47.840
Please think about it.

3
01:47.920 --> 01:50.560
I already agreed to pay in full. I can't keep giving in.

4
01:50.640 --> 01:51.840
3.98 million.

5
01:51.920 --> 01:54.080
Not a penny more.

6
01:55.840 --> 01:57.640
Okay, take care, sir.

7
02:04.400 --> 02:05.440
It's just a ten-grand difference.

8
02:05.520 --> 02:07.800
Why don't you cave a little, Xu?

9
02:08.560 --> 02:10.680
The landlord's whole family came to talk to you.

10
02:10.759 --> 02:12.080
That shows pretty good faith.

11
02:12.160 --> 02:13.280
I can give it a shot

12
02:13.360 --> 02:14.760
and try to get them down to 4.05 million for you.

13
02:15.520 --> 02:17.880
This landlord's too greedy.

14
02:17.960 --> 02:20.800
The second he heard I'd pay in full, he jacked up the price.

15
02:20.880 --> 02:23.320
Bet you if I agreed, he'd raise it again.

16
02:23.840 --> 02:25.960
Anyway, he backed out of the online signing.

17
02:26.040 --> 02:27.320
Just freeze him out for a few days.

18
02:28.360 --> 02:32.520
I do negotiations all the time. I know how sellers think.

19
02:32.600 --> 02:34.680
But his son keeps telling him not to sell.

20
02:34.760 --> 02:36.640
He says apartment prices have dropped way too much these years,

21
02:36.720 --> 02:38.600
so he wants to wait for them to bounce back.

22
02:39.120 --> 02:40.880
It's a rare opportunity, Xu.

23
02:41.840 --> 02:44.520
Your boyfriend seems pretty generous.

24
02:44.600 --> 02:47.240
It's exactly because of it that I can't throw money around like I'm rich.

25
02:47.840 --> 02:49.880
Zhu, I'll leave it to you these next few days.

26
02:49.960 --> 02:52.440
Please call him more and help me push the price down.

27
02:52.520 --> 02:53.640
Let me know if anything comes up, okay?

28
02:53.720 --> 02:56.000
-Alright. -Thank you. I'm leaving.

29
03:00.480 --> 03:02.440
Benyuan, Yuanzhou, and several other digital collectible platforms

30
03:02.520 --> 03:03.800
have blown up one after another.

31
03:03.880 --> 03:06.360
According to stats, over 300 police reports have been filed.

32
03:07.200 --> 03:08.960
Public security authorities are taking the matter seriously

33
03:09.040 --> 03:10.880
and have launched an official investigation.

34
03:10.960 --> 03:12.640
MULTIPLE DIGITAL COLLECTIBLES PLATFORMS SUSPECTED OF RUG PULLS

35
03:12.720 --> 03:13.840
ART INDEX PLUNGES 10%

36
03:17.040 --> 03:18.760
Hey, I saw the news.

37
03:18.840 --> 03:20.480
Is this you guys closing the net?

38
03:21.520 --> 03:23.880
No. Just a coincidence.

39
03:25.120 --> 03:27.840
It's actually months ahead of what Du and I had planned.

40
03:27.920 --> 03:31.000
But with Wen Ruosen expanding at full throttle like this,

41
03:31.520 --> 03:32.920
security problems were only a matter of time.

42
03:34.040 --> 03:37.040
Then the whole plan has to move up.

43
03:37.720 --> 03:38.600
Can I help with anything?

44
03:39.360 --> 03:40.360
No need.

45
03:40.880 --> 03:42.600
You have enough to deal with between your project

46
03:42.680 --> 03:44.000
and the apartment.

47
03:48.560 --> 03:50.480
Hold on. I'm getting a call. Don't hang up.

48
03:53.080 --> 03:54.400
Hey, Tianna, what's up?

49
03:57.960 --> 03:59.840
Yeah, yeah. Well,

50
04:00.440 --> 04:02.320
I'll get it done and send it to you now.

51
04:07.920 --> 04:09.000
Tianna called.

52
04:09.080 --> 04:12.160
I need to finish revising a file and send it to her before takeoff.

53
04:12.240 --> 04:14.440
I was up all night haggling with the landlord, so I forgot about it.

54
04:14.520 --> 04:15.760
Go do your thing. Bye.

55
04:16.360 --> 04:17.200
Okay.

56
04:17.800 --> 04:19.519
Wait, Chi.

57
04:19.600 --> 04:22.400
Let me say one more thing. Don't push yourself so hard.

58
04:22.480 --> 04:23.320
I'm a little worried about you.

59
04:24.040 --> 04:25.440
I know. I'm fine.

60
04:25.960 --> 04:27.840
You've got to give me a chance to learn from you.

61
04:27.920 --> 04:29.880
You're way busier than I am. Don't worry.

62
04:29.960 --> 04:31.080
Okay.

63
04:31.160 --> 04:33.160
Anyway, take care of yourself.

64
04:33.760 --> 04:35.880
Message me when you land in Shenzhen.

65
04:36.720 --> 04:37.560
Okay.

66
04:53.640 --> 04:56.360
What's so urgent that you had to come to me at this hour?

67
04:57.760 --> 04:58.760
I'm sick.

68
04:59.640 --> 05:01.320
Just spit it out and get going.

69
05:01.400 --> 05:02.720
I've got a really serious illness.

70
05:03.520 --> 05:04.560
Have a seat.

71
05:04.640 --> 05:07.080
Let me walk you through my condition.

72
05:19.000 --> 05:20.840
You want to know what those bald patches look like?

73
05:24.280 --> 05:25.640
That was me two years ago.

74
05:25.720 --> 05:27.000
The company was broke back then.

75
05:27.800 --> 05:29.000
I was barely holding on.

76
05:29.080 --> 05:30.440
I was pitching VCs every day.

77
05:32.000 --> 05:34.040
One day, on my way to meet a VC associate,

78
05:34.120 --> 05:35.680
I noticed I'd gotten bald patches.

79
05:36.400 --> 05:37.240
At seven in the morning,

80
05:37.320 --> 05:39.640
I went door to door at hair salons,

81
05:39.720 --> 05:41.280
begging them to shave my head.

82
05:42.760 --> 05:44.400
What does this have to do with your illness?

83
05:44.480 --> 05:45.840
Let me finish.

84
05:49.760 --> 05:50.640
OUTPATIENT RECORD

85
05:50.720 --> 05:51.760
This is my diagnosis report.

86
05:53.080 --> 05:54.640
I've got a really severe stomach ulcer.

87
05:55.880 --> 05:57.080
My stomach's a mess.

88
05:57.160 --> 06:00.200
I wish I could lock myself in the bathroom 24/7

89
06:00.720 --> 06:01.640
and be stuck at home for days.

90
06:06.240 --> 06:07.520
This is my ID,

91
06:07.600 --> 06:09.120
my household register, and my diploma.

92
06:12.440 --> 06:13.280
This is my family.

93
06:16.040 --> 06:17.920
My parents divorced when I was little.

94
06:18.000 --> 06:19.600
My dad ran off with someone else.

95
06:20.120 --> 06:22.680
And I never had a great relationship with my stepdad.

96
06:26.920 --> 06:28.480
These are my two best friends.

97
06:28.560 --> 06:29.600
My ride-or-dies.

98
06:30.680 --> 06:31.720
And…

99
06:34.040 --> 06:35.080
lastly,

100
06:35.920 --> 06:37.520
I want to introduce you

101
06:38.560 --> 06:39.800
to my favorite, Sun Wukong.

102
06:40.800 --> 06:42.200
Since third grade,

103
06:42.280 --> 06:43.480
I've taken him everywhere I go.

104
06:48.520 --> 06:49.680
I'm done.

105
06:55.000 --> 06:57.440
I've listened to all this, and I still don't get it.

106
06:57.520 --> 06:59.880
What does any of this have to do with me?

107
07:01.600 --> 07:02.960
Of course it does.

108
07:03.640 --> 07:04.840
You wouldn't accept me

109
07:05.440 --> 07:07.400
because you wanted to keep your dignity.

110
07:07.480 --> 07:08.320
I finally figured it out.

111
07:09.520 --> 07:11.840
It's just because when we first met,

112
07:11.920 --> 07:13.120
your work wasn't going well.

113
07:14.400 --> 07:16.120
Every day you were either dealing with your divorce

114
07:16.200 --> 07:17.400
or running to the hospital.

115
07:17.480 --> 07:19.960
You showed me all your worst moments.

116
07:20.560 --> 07:22.240
So it made you feel really awkward.

117
07:22.760 --> 07:25.360
Now I've shown you the realest version of me.

118
07:25.440 --> 07:27.160
And I'm telling you, I've got plenty of mess too.

119
07:27.240 --> 07:28.080
Now we're even.

120
07:29.280 --> 07:32.680
I'm really not as glamorous as you think.

121
07:32.760 --> 07:34.760
I've had my ugly, pathetic moments too.

122
07:34.840 --> 07:37.240
Every morning I woke up to a mountain of mess.

123
07:38.360 --> 07:39.800
Let me be straight with you.

124
07:40.400 --> 07:41.720
Because of Bolo,

125
07:41.800 --> 07:43.880
my apartment's still mortgaged to the bank.

126
07:44.480 --> 07:47.320
If one day Bolo blows up like those digital collectible platforms,

127
07:47.400 --> 07:48.360
I might not even

128
07:48.440 --> 07:50.080
have money for a hair transplant.

129
07:54.840 --> 07:56.280
I'm telling you all this

130
07:57.400 --> 07:59.040
because I want you to know…

131
08:04.640 --> 08:05.480
I really like you.

132
08:08.200 --> 08:09.680
I used to like

133
08:10.800 --> 08:12.800
the tough act you put on.

134
08:13.880 --> 08:15.080
Now I like the you who,

135
08:15.160 --> 08:17.680
even after being knocked down a thousand times,

136
08:17.760 --> 08:21.480
still gets back up and tries to live a beautiful life.

137
08:29.240 --> 08:30.320
Can you give me a chance?

138
08:30.920 --> 08:32.440
And give yourself one too?

139
08:33.280 --> 08:35.880
You bring your lipstick, and I'll bring my toys.

140
08:35.960 --> 08:38.480
Let's have some drinks and get some hot pot.

141
08:38.559 --> 08:41.480
Let's go on a nice trip. That's better than anything.

142
08:41.559 --> 08:42.799
Stop.

143
08:49.200 --> 08:50.040
Okay.

144
08:51.600 --> 08:52.440
I won't say anything.

145
08:56.240 --> 08:57.080
I'll show you.

146
09:42.480 --> 09:43.800
-Morning. -Morning.

147
09:56.040 --> 09:57.200
MESSAGE

148
09:59.200 --> 10:00.600
FIRST TIME I'M ACTUALLY THANKFUL FOR MY MOTHER SETTING UP THAT BLIND DATE

149
10:02.000 --> 10:04.240
Who even sends MMS these days.

150
10:05.600 --> 10:08.640
First time I'm actually thankful for my mother setting up that blind date.

151
10:08.720 --> 10:11.520
Beautiful Tianna, nice to meet you.

152
10:13.600 --> 10:14.680
Blind date?

153
10:39.720 --> 10:41.880
What's wrong with you? You've been acting weird all morning.

154
10:43.600 --> 10:44.440
Didn't sleep well last night.

155
10:45.680 --> 10:48.240
Stop lying. You've never treated me like this before.

156
10:50.000 --> 10:51.280
It's really nothing.

157
10:52.800 --> 10:54.000
You're really pushing it now?

158
10:54.080 --> 10:55.520
Tell me what's going on right now or we're breaking up.

159
11:01.080 --> 11:02.040
Fine.

160
11:04.720 --> 11:05.560
Were we ever even together?

161
11:11.360 --> 11:12.320
Then how can we break up?

162
11:26.920 --> 11:27.760
What's wrong with you?

163
11:34.680 --> 11:35.640
FIRST TIME I'M ACTUALLY THANKFUL FOR MY MOTHER SETTING UP THAT BLIND DATE

164
11:35.720 --> 11:36.560
BEAUTIFUL TIANNA, NICE TO MEET YOU

165
11:42.160 --> 11:44.200
Let me explain. Here's the thing.

166
11:44.280 --> 11:46.240
I did have a meal with Shen Jin.

167
11:46.320 --> 11:48.840
And I did joke around with him a bit about Lin.

168
11:48.920 --> 11:50.360
-And then… -Were you two on a date?

169
11:51.360 --> 11:52.240
Are you interrogating me?

170
11:53.120 --> 11:54.160
You know

171
11:54.240 --> 11:56.520
my family has certain social obligations we can't avoid.

172
11:56.600 --> 11:57.880
Don't be like this, okay?

173
11:57.960 --> 11:59.800
Something just occurred to me.

174
11:59.880 --> 12:01.320
I've got two good friends.

175
12:02.080 --> 12:03.240
Both total characters.

176
12:03.840 --> 12:05.720
One's a scheming guy.

177
12:06.520 --> 12:08.960
He knows his girlfriend is going on blind dates,

178
12:09.040 --> 12:12.280
and he still acts like nothing's wrong and treats her all sweet.

179
12:12.360 --> 12:13.960
He took advantage of her guilt,

180
12:14.040 --> 12:15.800
slept with her, got her pregnant, married her,

181
12:15.880 --> 12:17.280
and called it a win.

182
12:18.880 --> 12:21.160
My other friend is pretty average.

183
12:21.240 --> 12:24.120
He takes things personally. He gets upset, he gets angry,

184
12:24.720 --> 12:25.640
and he starts wondering

185
12:25.720 --> 12:27.840
what kind of relationship he and his girlfriend actually have

186
12:27.920 --> 12:30.200
when, after all this time, she still won't acknowledge him

187
12:30.280 --> 12:32.240
in front of her colleagues and friends.

188
12:32.320 --> 12:33.400
She even

189
12:33.920 --> 12:36.400
thinks going on blind dates is just normal socializing.

190
12:37.000 --> 12:38.720
Aren't my two friends interesting?

191
12:38.800 --> 12:41.400
If you were me, which one would you pick?

192
12:46.600 --> 12:47.960
They're definitely interesting.

193
12:48.560 --> 12:49.440
Right?

194
12:51.320 --> 12:52.240
So you want to fight?

195
12:55.200 --> 12:56.480
Then let me ask you,

196
12:57.320 --> 12:59.160
isn't Xu Chi our friend?

197
12:59.240 --> 13:00.680
Doesn't she know about us?

198
13:00.760 --> 13:03.120
-And Ye Xinzhi also-- -I really don't wanna fight.

199
13:03.880 --> 13:05.240
I just want you to tell me

200
13:05.320 --> 13:06.840
which of these two versions

201
13:07.760 --> 13:08.960
of Zhao Heng you prefer.

202
13:15.840 --> 13:16.680
You--

203
13:35.800 --> 13:38.520
Shen Jin, tell me straight. What are you getting at?

204
13:38.600 --> 13:39.880
Hold on.

205
13:39.960 --> 13:41.600
You'll be thanking me later.

206
13:43.080 --> 13:44.560
BU TIANNA, MAXMISE

207
13:44.640 --> 13:45.880
Hello?

208
14:15.800 --> 14:18.560
-Wen Ruosen's had a tough run lately. -What happened?

209
14:18.640 --> 14:20.760
He's about to face criminal charges.

210
14:20.840 --> 14:22.720
-Really? -Yeah. Look.

211
14:23.520 --> 14:25.960
After getting sued, he got dragged

212
14:26.040 --> 14:27.160
into a bunch of platform blowups?

213
14:27.240 --> 14:28.440
Yeah. On top of that,

214
14:28.520 --> 14:30.960
buyers are flocking to his gallery to protest,

215
14:31.040 --> 14:33.680
claiming he and the platforms ran a rat trading scheme.

216
14:35.720 --> 14:37.480
Excuse me. Can I borrow your phone for a sec?

217
14:39.680 --> 14:40.640
Thanks.

218
14:48.120 --> 14:48.960
Thanks.

219
15:02.080 --> 15:04.080
Xinzhi, it's me. The Yuanzhou thing…

220
15:04.160 --> 15:05.840
Yeah, this time it was us.

221
15:05.920 --> 15:07.360
Du's team was monitoring public opinion

222
15:07.440 --> 15:09.400
and saw people going to the gallery to protest,

223
15:09.480 --> 15:10.800
so they pushed a few trending topics.

224
15:12.760 --> 15:14.160
I was just about to tell you.

225
15:14.240 --> 15:16.520
I sat in on a local CBIRC meeting this morning.

226
15:16.600 --> 15:18.680
A bank mentioned they're pulling loans from several

227
15:18.760 --> 15:20.120
collectible companies with bad reputations.

228
15:20.200 --> 15:21.640
Yuanzhou is one of them.

229
15:22.240 --> 15:24.200
Got it. With this intel,

230
15:24.280 --> 15:27.200
I can go tip off Wen Ruosen's lending bank in Beijing.

231
15:29.480 --> 15:31.680
So? Officer Rabbit's pretty impressive, huh?

232
15:31.760 --> 15:33.000
Impressive.

233
15:33.080 --> 15:35.040
When I got handcuffed, I was terrified.

234
15:36.200 --> 15:38.000
You're a bad guy. Talk to you later.

235
15:38.080 --> 15:39.640
I have to work a bit more.

236
15:40.680 --> 15:42.760
-Let's meet when I'm back. -By the way,

237
15:43.320 --> 15:45.200
how do you get to sit in on finance sector meetings?

238
15:45.280 --> 15:46.400
You went to Celestial again?

239
15:47.680 --> 15:50.520
I had no choice. The project's wrapping up.

240
15:50.600 --> 15:52.960
Final delivery's next week.

241
15:53.480 --> 15:55.160
So I'm just going nonstop.

242
15:56.120 --> 15:58.760
I've only slept about six hours these past two days.

243
15:59.280 --> 16:01.680
In half an hour, I'm heading to the airport to fly to Chengdu.

244
16:02.280 --> 16:04.040
It's really satisfying, though.

245
16:04.120 --> 16:06.280
I've been on the road and already finished deliveries

246
16:06.360 --> 16:07.280
for two branch offices.

247
16:08.080 --> 16:09.720
But Tianna

248
16:09.800 --> 16:11.080
is not having a great day.

249
16:12.280 --> 16:14.760
A file she delivered got rejected by Celestial again.

250
16:14.840 --> 16:16.720
She's putting on a brave face,

251
16:16.800 --> 16:18.160
but I know she's crushed inside.

252
16:18.960 --> 16:20.000
Send me your location.

253
16:20.080 --> 16:20.960
Why?

254
16:21.040 --> 16:23.080
The sly old fox wants to treat his little rabbit

255
16:23.160 --> 16:24.240
to a luxury ride,

256
16:24.320 --> 16:26.080
complete with a zero-gravity seat

257
16:26.160 --> 16:27.720
for some real sleep. Is that okay?

258
16:33.960 --> 16:35.120
Thank you.

259
16:37.720 --> 16:39.560
Mr. Ye wanted me to buy these as fast as possible.

260
16:39.640 --> 16:41.800
Good thing there's a flower shop right by me.

261
16:42.320 --> 16:43.320
Miss Xu, please.

262
16:48.640 --> 16:50.000
And this hot chocolate.

263
16:50.080 --> 16:52.120
Mr. Ye said you have to drink it.

264
16:53.080 --> 16:53.920
Thanks.

265
16:55.360 --> 16:56.840
But this is such a waste.

266
16:56.920 --> 16:58.920
I can't take it on the plane.

267
16:59.600 --> 17:01.120
That just makes Mr. Ye even more romantic.

268
17:01.200 --> 17:02.640
Even if it's only half an hour of joy,

269
17:02.720 --> 17:04.280
he wants you to have it.

270
17:21.880 --> 17:23.240
Got it.

271
17:23.319 --> 17:25.319
I'll confirm that with them later.

272
17:27.000 --> 17:27.839
Okay.

273
17:34.440 --> 17:35.480
WECHAT

274
17:35.560 --> 17:38.480
Xu, are you there? Urgent. Please reply.

275
17:38.560 --> 17:39.840
Xu, are you there?

276
17:39.920 --> 17:41.920
-Xu? -Did the landlord agree?

277
17:42.640 --> 17:44.360
Okay. Let me note that down.

278
17:47.000 --> 17:48.520
Ms. Xu, you finally got back to me.

279
17:48.600 --> 17:50.760
No word from the landlord yet, but there's something else urgent.

280
17:50.840 --> 17:53.480
I can't say it over WeChat. Can we talk on the phone right now?

281
17:54.640 --> 17:56.160
Not a good time. I'm busy. I'll hit you back later.

282
17:57.680 --> 17:59.640
I'm listening, Mr. Zheng. Please go ahead.

283
17:59.720 --> 18:00.480
MR. ZHENG

284
18:00.560 --> 18:01.400
ZHU, AGENT

285
18:04.760 --> 18:08.120
Sorry. Is it the whole company or the whole department?

286
18:13.680 --> 18:15.080
I told you I'm busy.

287
18:15.160 --> 18:17.160
Xu, don't hang up yet. Something happened.

288
18:17.240 --> 18:18.520
Zhu, I really don't have time right now.

289
18:18.600 --> 18:20.320
Call me when the landlord agrees, okay? Bye.

290
18:21.040 --> 18:23.680
Sorry, Mr. Zheng. I just got a call. Please continue.

291
19:01.000 --> 19:03.680
According to the management of Celestial's Jiangxi branch…

292
19:04.200 --> 19:06.560
-Jiangxi? -What's going on?

293
19:10.600 --> 19:11.600
CELESTIAL INSURANCE JIANGSU BRANCH

294
19:12.280 --> 19:14.880
Sorry. Jiangsu.

295
19:15.400 --> 19:16.960
I… I've been on the road these past few days.

296
19:17.040 --> 19:18.680
I'm losing all sense of time and place.

297
19:18.760 --> 19:19.800
Sorry.

298
19:20.360 --> 19:22.280
Now let me walk you through the restructuring

299
19:22.360 --> 19:23.560
of the intelligent underwriting system.

300
19:25.200 --> 19:27.080
Ma'am, please fasten your seatbelt.

301
19:28.640 --> 19:30.600
Sir, please stow your tray table.

302
19:30.680 --> 19:32.400
Sir, please open the window shade.

303
19:32.920 --> 19:34.720
Ma'am, the seat back needs to be upright.

304
19:35.640 --> 19:37.120
Ma'am, the tray table needs to be stowed.

305
19:58.240 --> 20:01.200
Xu, it's on the news. Now I can tell you.

306
20:01.720 --> 20:03.160
Your old apartment is Number 92.

307
20:03.240 --> 20:04.680
Experts have deemed it unsafe to live in.

308
20:04.760 --> 20:06.800
They're evacuating residents right now.

309
20:11.200 --> 20:12.040
ILLEGAL BASEMENT DIGGING IN YONG'AN ROAD COURTYARD NO. 91

310
20:12.120 --> 20:12.960
CAUSES INDOOR COLLAPSE

311
20:13.480 --> 20:16.560
SINKHOLE SUDDENLY OPENS IN RESIDENTIAL AREA

312
20:16.640 --> 20:17.480
SEVERAL BUILDINGS LEFT CRACKED

313
20:21.880 --> 20:23.040
Ladies and gentlemen,

314
20:23.120 --> 20:25.440
the plane is descending through cloud cover.

315
20:25.520 --> 20:27.760
There'll be some turbulence. Please don't worry.

316
20:36.160 --> 20:37.000
A HOME IN YONG'AN ROAD COURTYARD NO. 91 COLLAPSED

317
20:37.080 --> 20:38.800
ILLEGAL BASEMENT CONSTRUCTION CAUSING RIVER WATER TO FLOOD IN

318
20:38.880 --> 20:39.720
A 30-METER SINKHOLE APPEARED

319
20:39.800 --> 20:40.640
AFFECTING TEN NEARBY BUILDINGS

320
20:49.840 --> 20:51.320
XU CHI

321
20:52.840 --> 20:56.160
Sorry. The number you have dialed is powered off.

322
21:03.680 --> 21:04.520
CA7622 16:35 LANDING

323
21:05.280 --> 21:07.280
XU CHI

324
21:13.040 --> 21:15.080
Chen. Skip the venue.

325
21:15.160 --> 21:16.600
Take me to Yong'an Road No. 92.

326
21:22.320 --> 21:24.160
Something came up. I can't make it.

327
21:24.240 --> 21:28.360
YE XINZHI

328
21:32.040 --> 21:33.040
-Hello? -What's going on?

329
21:33.120 --> 21:34.720
A room full of people are waiting for you, man.

330
21:34.800 --> 21:37.520
Du, can you run it for me?

331
21:37.600 --> 21:38.640
Something came up on my end.

332
21:38.720 --> 21:41.920
Plus, you know media and PR better than I do.

333
21:42.000 --> 21:43.520
What are you even saying, man?

334
21:43.600 --> 21:45.280
This was your thing from the start.

335
21:45.920 --> 21:47.680
We finally got Yuanzhou to blow up.

336
21:47.760 --> 21:49.960
I got the best people in the business to help you stir up public opinion.

337
21:50.040 --> 21:51.520
And now you're not coming?

338
21:51.600 --> 21:53.760
So who's gonna call the shots on the messaging?

339
21:53.840 --> 21:55.720
Who's gonna handle the strategy going forward?

340
21:55.800 --> 21:57.680
I've pretty much drafted the whole strategy and plan.

341
21:57.760 --> 21:58.600
I'll email it to you in a bit.

342
21:58.680 --> 21:59.840
Don't bother! I'm not reading it!

343
21:59.920 --> 22:01.280
Don't get so worked up.

344
22:01.360 --> 22:02.520
What's so earth-shattering

345
22:02.600 --> 22:04.360
that you'd bail on me right now?

346
22:04.440 --> 22:05.280
By…

347
22:08.480 --> 22:11.040
Is… Is something wrong with Xu Chi?

348
22:12.080 --> 22:13.400
Something happened with the apartment she's buying.

349
22:14.440 --> 22:17.240
What does her apartment have to do with you?

350
22:17.320 --> 22:19.920
Man, don't you hate Wen Ruosen?

351
22:20.000 --> 22:20.960
Haven't you been dreaming of making

352
22:21.040 --> 22:22.680
him pay for what he did to Jingshang's victims?

353
22:22.760 --> 22:23.920
How could you let

354
22:24.000 --> 22:26.200
some girl's apartment problem…

355
22:26.280 --> 22:29.000
How could you let some tiny little thing ruin everything after getting this far?

356
22:29.080 --> 22:29.960
Du.

357
22:30.480 --> 22:32.120
Our plan against Wen Ruosen

358
22:32.200 --> 22:33.920
has been in the works for years.

359
22:34.680 --> 22:37.040
Even if there's a little hiccup with the media rollout,

360
22:37.120 --> 22:38.400
it won't change the big picture.

361
22:38.480 --> 22:40.280
I'm trusting you with this.

362
22:40.360 --> 22:41.840
Just tell them I suddenly got sick or missed my flight.

363
22:41.920 --> 22:42.760
Do me this solid, okay?

364
22:43.840 --> 22:45.120
Is she really that important?

365
22:45.200 --> 22:48.760
More important than the revenge you've waited years for?

366
22:50.160 --> 22:51.000
Yes.

367
22:52.280 --> 22:54.120
Because my hatred for Wen Ruosen is in the past.

368
22:54.200 --> 22:55.440
But she

369
22:56.520 --> 22:57.560
is my future.

370
22:59.240 --> 23:00.080
HAZARDOUS WORK IN PROGRESS AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

371
23:00.840 --> 23:02.840
‎-Everyone, please calm down. ‎-My stuff is still in there!

372
23:02.920 --> 23:04.920
‎-Everything is under inspection now. ‎-Please let us in.

373
23:05.000 --> 23:07.120
‎-Please move back a little. ‎-What are we supposed to do?

374
23:07.200 --> 23:10.280
‎-Please step back. Don't push. ‎-Let us in!

375
23:11.040 --> 23:13.600
‎We will come up with a solution. ‎Everyone, please stay calm.

376
23:14.400 --> 23:17.200
‎Please step back for safety. ‎It's very dangerous.

377
23:17.280 --> 23:19.520
‎Why is everything being taken away?

378
23:19.600 --> 23:20.600
‎Stop pushing!

379
23:20.680 --> 23:22.160
‎Don't crowd.

380
23:22.240 --> 23:23.880
‎Step back a little.

381
23:29.560 --> 23:30.520
Chi.

382
23:31.400 --> 23:32.320
What's wrong?

383
23:33.200 --> 23:35.520
Chi? Chi?

384
23:36.480 --> 23:37.480
Chi, are you okay?

385
23:38.520 --> 23:40.840
Chi, there are too many people here.

386
23:41.360 --> 23:42.360
Let's go home, alright?

387
23:45.400 --> 23:46.720
Let's go home, alright?

388
23:49.640 --> 23:51.000
What did you say?

389
23:52.120 --> 23:53.080
I can't hear you.

390
23:54.640 --> 23:55.480
You can't hear?

391
23:56.200 --> 23:59.160
What's wrong? Chi!

392
24:02.480 --> 24:03.440
Chi!

393
24:04.080 --> 24:05.080
Chi!

394
24:08.160 --> 24:09.600
How did the meeting go?

395
24:10.840 --> 24:13.120
Don't worry. I've got no objections.

396
24:14.160 --> 24:15.440
I'll be there next time for sure.

397
24:16.400 --> 24:18.160
How's your little girl doing?

398
24:19.360 --> 24:21.800
She just got the IV. Still hasn't come around.

399
24:22.880 --> 24:24.560
She's awake, but she's still not stable.

400
24:24.640 --> 24:26.080
-Come take a look. -Hang on a sec!

401
24:26.160 --> 24:28.320
Have you seen my laptop?

402
24:29.120 --> 24:30.160
-My laptop… -You're awake.

403
24:30.680 --> 24:32.240
You've got barotrauma of the ear.

404
24:32.320 --> 24:33.520
The doctor said they've treated you.

405
24:33.600 --> 24:36.160
-What did you say? I can't hear you. -She still can't hear?

406
24:36.240 --> 24:37.520
-No, we still need to monitor her. -What's wrong with me?

407
24:38.160 --> 24:39.720
What's wrong with my ears? I can't hear!

408
24:40.400 --> 24:42.280
-Am I okay? -You're fine.

409
24:50.920 --> 24:52.480
YOU'VE GOT EAR BAROTRAUMA THE DOCTOR SAID THEY'VE TREATED YOU

410
24:52.560 --> 24:54.120
BUT YOU NEED TO REST I'M HERE. DON'T BE SCARED

411
24:59.800 --> 25:01.120
I'm fine. I'm not scared.

412
25:01.880 --> 25:04.360
I'm healthy. I'll definitely be fine after some sleep.

413
25:04.440 --> 25:05.520
Yeah, yeah.

414
25:05.600 --> 25:08.400
Where's my laptop? It's got the files I just revised.

415
25:08.480 --> 25:10.280
-It's here. -I need to go to the office tomorrow.

416
25:10.360 --> 25:12.040
-Yeah, yeah. -Let me go back, okay?

417
25:12.120 --> 25:13.800
Don't be scared. Just rest.

418
25:13.880 --> 25:14.760
I'll stay with you. Listen to me, alright?

419
25:20.400 --> 25:22.880
I AM HERE WITH YOU

420
25:25.680 --> 25:27.240
I AM HERE

421
25:29.880 --> 25:32.160
ALRIGHT?

422
26:43.320 --> 26:47.960
EMERGENCY ROOM

423
27:01.840 --> 27:02.680
I'll stay with you.

424
27:05.720 --> 27:07.040
Sleep.

425
27:50.760 --> 27:52.720
BAROTRAUMA OF THE EAR

426
27:55.360 --> 27:57.200
BAROTRAUMATIC OTITIS MEDIA

427
27:58.960 --> 28:00.560
EUSTACHIAN TUBE DYSFUNCTION RAPID EXTERNAL PRESSURE CHANGES

428
28:05.160 --> 28:06.680
Scumbag.

429
28:07.200 --> 28:08.760
Scum… Scumbag.

430
28:13.080 --> 28:16.560
I've got nothing left!

431
28:16.640 --> 28:18.320
You've got me.

432
28:19.200 --> 28:22.400
Chi, I've got nothing left.

433
29:25.040 --> 29:27.560
Now I can't hear, just like you.

434
29:28.800 --> 29:30.040
Let it all out. Cry.

435
29:30.560 --> 29:31.840
I'm right here.

436
31:28.800 --> 31:29.840
See that?

437
31:30.680 --> 31:32.440
You were awesome just now.

438
31:32.520 --> 31:33.800
Right?

439
31:40.560 --> 31:41.800
You know why I'm so accurate?

440
31:42.320 --> 31:43.320
Why?

441
31:44.640 --> 31:46.360
Is bowling good for this too?

442
31:47.200 --> 31:49.320
You know why I'm good at bowling?

443
31:49.400 --> 31:50.680
Why?

444
31:51.400 --> 31:52.560
Feel it.

445
31:54.320 --> 31:55.640
I've felt it before.

446
31:59.640 --> 32:01.680
We're out having fun.

447
32:02.280 --> 32:03.480
I'm not out having fun.

448
32:03.560 --> 32:05.560
I'm here for work. You insisted on tagging along.

449
32:05.640 --> 32:08.240
I moved my conference call to noon

450
32:08.320 --> 32:11.200
just so I'd have an excuse to sneak out and see you.

451
32:11.800 --> 32:13.600
We just got together.

452
32:13.680 --> 32:15.480
There's gotta be some romance to it, right?

453
32:15.560 --> 32:16.840
If you ask me,

454
32:16.920 --> 32:18.800
why don't you just quit Maxmise?

455
32:18.880 --> 32:19.720
Join my company.

456
32:23.600 --> 32:25.280
Shen Jin, I thought

457
32:25.360 --> 32:26.480
you were different from my ex-husband.

458
32:27.760 --> 32:30.120
Come on. I was just saying it off the top of my head.

459
32:30.200 --> 32:32.680
You know how strong Bolo is.

460
32:33.200 --> 32:34.920
I just don't want you working so hard.

461
32:35.680 --> 32:39.000
But I don't like people planning out my life. Okay?

462
32:41.880 --> 32:42.800
Sure.

463
32:44.600 --> 32:45.600
Sure.

464
33:14.280 --> 33:15.320
Xinzhi!

465
33:16.360 --> 33:17.480
Xinzhi, where's my laptop bag?

466
33:17.560 --> 33:18.720
-I need to go to the office. -Forget the laptop.

467
33:18.800 --> 33:20.080
I asked Sha Sha for the day off for you.

468
33:20.760 --> 33:23.240
No. I've got a meeting at 9:10.

469
33:24.800 --> 33:26.000
You can hear now?

470
33:30.440 --> 33:32.200
She still has some ringing and fullness in her ears.

471
33:32.880 --> 33:34.040
But she can communicate fine.

472
33:35.800 --> 33:36.840
37.9 degrees Celsius.

473
33:39.680 --> 33:41.480
It's good to be young. Recovers so fast.

474
33:42.000 --> 33:43.360
Alright, Dr. Liu. Don't worry.

475
33:43.440 --> 33:45.240
I'll bring her over for her IV this afternoon.

476
33:48.280 --> 33:49.400
No work.

477
33:49.480 --> 33:52.000
I'm fine now. This meeting's really important.

478
33:52.080 --> 33:55.400
Dr. Liu said normal turbulence wouldn't cause barotrauma.

479
33:55.480 --> 33:56.440
Your ear problem

480
33:56.520 --> 33:58.960
is definitely from fatigue or stress.

481
33:59.560 --> 34:00.680
I'm fine now.

482
34:02.400 --> 34:03.480
I've got meetings today too.

483
34:03.560 --> 34:05.760
Even I can take a day off. Why don't you try it?

484
34:06.360 --> 34:08.159
Take a break. The world won't stop turning.

485
34:10.639 --> 34:11.800
Here.

486
34:11.880 --> 34:13.480
Enjoy.

487
34:39.920 --> 34:40.760
Chi.

488
34:42.040 --> 34:43.800
I really need to have a serious talk with you.

489
34:45.280 --> 34:46.400
I know what you're gonna say.

490
34:46.480 --> 34:48.040
I've actually already summed it up myself.

491
34:48.719 --> 34:51.760
My biggest problem this time was that I was overconfident.

492
34:52.280 --> 34:54.639
You kept telling me to seize the opportunity and act fast.

493
34:55.320 --> 34:57.280
But I wasn't happy that the landlord raised the price,

494
34:57.360 --> 34:59.760
and I wanted to show off my negotiating skills,

495
34:59.840 --> 35:01.760
and I forgot to keep an eye on what was going on outside.

496
35:01.840 --> 35:03.040
That's what led to all this.

497
35:08.040 --> 35:08.880
Chi.

498
35:08.960 --> 35:10.600
I'm your boyfriend,

499
35:10.680 --> 35:11.600
not your boss.

500
35:11.680 --> 35:13.120
No need to report every mistake to me.

501
35:15.960 --> 35:17.720
I know. I'm not.

502
35:21.960 --> 35:23.560
But good thing the place didn't go through.

503
35:24.400 --> 35:26.080
Otherwise, it'd be deemed unsafe,

504
35:26.600 --> 35:27.840
and your money would've gone down the drain.

505
35:27.920 --> 35:29.880
Money doesn't matter at all.

506
35:30.400 --> 35:32.200
Your health is what matters most.

507
35:32.280 --> 35:34.600
Your ears are already acting up. That's life giving you a warning.

508
35:34.680 --> 35:36.520
You can't keep doing this, or you're really gonna crash.

509
35:37.360 --> 35:39.520
But I already promised you I wouldn't go to work today.

510
35:40.120 --> 35:41.200
Not just today.

511
35:41.720 --> 35:43.320
You're too driven.

512
35:43.400 --> 35:44.640
You want to win at everything.

513
35:44.720 --> 35:46.800
You're secretly competing with Bu Tianna.

514
35:47.840 --> 35:49.120
Is it really that hard to accept

515
35:49.200 --> 35:50.520
that she became project manager first?

516
35:52.800 --> 35:54.320
Nobody goes through life without ever failing.

517
35:54.400 --> 35:57.320
A consultant who's never gotten used to being surpassed

518
35:57.840 --> 35:59.120
isn't really a seasoned pro.

519
36:06.840 --> 36:08.040
But I already failed.

520
36:09.880 --> 36:12.320
The agent said an unsafe building can't be sold.

521
36:12.400 --> 36:15.040
I'll never be able to buy my mom's apartment back.

522
36:15.560 --> 36:16.840
How did you fail?

523
36:16.920 --> 36:19.160
Is that apartment really that important to you?

524
36:19.240 --> 36:20.960
Of course it is.

525
36:21.480 --> 36:23.560
It's the place my mom always dreamed about.

526
36:23.640 --> 36:24.880
It's my whole sense of security.

527
36:26.120 --> 36:27.800
From an outsider's perspective,

528
36:28.320 --> 36:29.640
that apartment can't give you security anymore.

529
36:30.880 --> 36:32.880
Before, whenever something happened,

530
36:32.960 --> 36:34.560
you'd go hole up in that place.

531
36:35.640 --> 36:37.800
But recently, during your leave,

532
36:37.880 --> 36:38.760
you never went there.

533
36:39.480 --> 36:42.680
And when you got busy, you'd even forget to call the agent back.

534
36:43.560 --> 36:44.400
Chi,

535
36:44.480 --> 36:46.480
is that apartment really that irreplaceable?

536
36:47.880 --> 36:49.880
What was your mom's last wish, really?

537
36:50.560 --> 36:52.040
Did she make you promise to buy that apartment back?

538
36:59.880 --> 37:01.280
Before my mom passed,

539
37:02.440 --> 37:03.440
all she wanted was for me to be okay.

540
37:05.040 --> 37:06.120
Exactly.

541
37:07.120 --> 37:09.400
That was a goal you set for yourself,

542
37:09.480 --> 37:11.880
a shackle you put on yourself.

543
37:12.640 --> 37:15.400
Your mom would've wanted you to live happy and healthy

544
37:15.480 --> 37:16.600
every day,

545
37:18.080 --> 37:19.280
not worn out like this.

546
37:21.240 --> 37:23.680
But without that apartment as my goal,

547
37:25.000 --> 37:26.960
I don't know what the point of my life is.

548
37:27.840 --> 37:29.000
You tell me not to push so hard,

549
37:29.080 --> 37:32.160
but if I don't work overtime, I don't know where to go.

550
37:40.040 --> 37:41.080
Come with me.

551
37:50.440 --> 37:52.480
You know why I rented a place here?

552
37:53.320 --> 37:54.560
Because from here,

553
37:54.640 --> 37:57.200
you can see the city's bustling CBD.

554
37:57.280 --> 37:59.480
And it lets you feel the everyday world too.

555
38:00.080 --> 38:02.400
Look over there. Those old trees.

556
38:02.920 --> 38:04.120
When spring comes,

557
38:04.200 --> 38:07.080
the peach, pear, and crabapple trees are all in bloom.

558
38:07.600 --> 38:10.080
Any quick phone snap turns out amazing.

559
38:11.480 --> 38:14.640
That alley over there has my favorite barbershop.

560
38:14.720 --> 38:17.280
The stylist in there talks way too much,

561
38:17.360 --> 38:18.840
but he's great at actual haircuts.

562
38:19.600 --> 38:21.960
And by that patch of green over there,

563
38:22.480 --> 38:25.320
there is a really great baozi shop.

564
38:25.400 --> 38:26.640
Really juicy.

565
38:26.720 --> 38:28.160
One bite and it's burning hot,

566
38:28.240 --> 38:29.520
but so savory.

567
38:30.320 --> 38:33.280
Chi, have you ever experienced any of this?

568
38:39.760 --> 38:41.360
My life…

569
38:43.480 --> 38:44.880
is basically just

570
38:45.840 --> 38:48.400
offices, hotels,

571
38:48.960 --> 38:50.200
office buildings, and airports.

572
38:50.800 --> 38:51.760
Then I'll show you from now on.

573
38:53.280 --> 38:54.600
Truth is, there are

574
38:54.680 --> 38:57.000
so many simple, everyday things in life

575
38:57.880 --> 38:59.280
that we just need to make an effort to appreciate.

576
39:03.480 --> 39:04.760
Forget about that old apartment.

577
39:07.080 --> 39:08.360
Let me give you that sense of security. Alright?

578
39:15.000 --> 39:17.920
I bought it ages ago. At the jewelry store right next to P&J.

579
39:18.000 --> 39:19.280
The place we first met.

580
39:52.880 --> 39:53.720
Will you marry me?

581
39:56.320 --> 39:57.400
Please don't think

582
39:58.480 --> 39:59.840
I'm making a move because you're vulnerable.

583
40:10.480 --> 40:11.400
I…

584
40:14.760 --> 40:16.160
I'm really happy.

585
40:18.240 --> 40:20.640
But I don't think I'm ready yet.

586
40:28.400 --> 40:29.720
Knew you'd say that.

587
40:29.800 --> 40:31.120
It's a two-in-one.

588
40:36.800 --> 40:38.200
You can wear it for now.

589
40:38.280 --> 40:40.920
Whenever you're ready, just tell me.

590
40:58.280 --> 40:59.240
It's on.

591
41:03.000 --> 41:04.040
Do you like it?

592
41:21.040 --> 41:22.240
Thank you.

593
41:24.240 --> 41:26.560
I also have myself to thank.

594
41:27.920 --> 41:30.320
Back at that interview,

595
41:31.040 --> 41:33.640
I outperformed and moved the heavens…

596
41:36.200 --> 41:37.640
which is how I got to meet you.

597
42:21.360 --> 42:23.360
That's the delivery I completed for Celestial's

598
42:23.440 --> 42:26.760
four branch offices in the form of training and workshops. Thank you.

599
42:37.360 --> 42:39.880
If there are no issues, that's a wrap for today's meeting.

600
42:43.160 --> 42:45.320
Miss Xu, thank you.

601
42:45.400 --> 42:46.400
No worries.

602
42:48.000 --> 42:49.120
Tianna.

603
42:50.120 --> 42:52.600
Hope the rest of the delivery goes as smoothly and efficiently as today's.

604
42:54.520 --> 42:55.960
Please rest assured. I'll get it done.

605
42:57.480 --> 42:58.600
By the way,

606
42:59.160 --> 43:00.920
I've already booked the celebration dinner

607
43:01.000 --> 43:02.040
for after the project wraps next week.

608
43:02.120 --> 43:03.560
Everyone's been eating at the Celestial cafeteria for so long.

609
43:03.640 --> 43:05.080
I figured you'd want a change of pace.

610
43:05.160 --> 43:06.520
Then I'm bringing two good bottles of wine.

611
43:11.000 --> 43:13.080
So? Are you holding up okay?

612
43:13.160 --> 43:14.920
I'm in perfect shape.

613
43:18.560 --> 43:19.800
Oh my.

614
43:25.880 --> 43:26.720
